    rdf:value "Helmut Humbach and Prods O. Skjærvø, 1978, \"The Sassanian Inscription of Paikuli; Part I; Supplement to Herzfeld's Paikuli. Wiesbaden: Dr. Ludwig Reichert Verlag and Tehran: The Iranian Culture Foundation.\"" .

