    crm:P72_has_language lang:ara ;
    rdf:value "Additional information from Joseph Upton's Finding Aid reads, \"Arabic No. 36: [no neg.] Pasargadae. E door near tomb of Cyrus. Gateway of Salgharid Muzaffar Sa'd, 591-623 H. In five sections, numbered 36/36d. See N-117, p.68 and opposite p.69.\"" .

