    rdf:value "Herzfeld, Ernst, 1924: \"Paikuli: Monument and Inscription of the Early History of the Sasanian Empire; Volume II, containing 228 plates. Berlin: D. Reimer, Ernst Vohsen. Plate 119.\"" .

