    rdf:value "Scope and Contents Excavation of Persepolis (Iran): Squeeze of Inscription, XPc, Elamite Version, on the Central Facade of the South Wall of the South Portico of the Tachara" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

