    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Additional information from Joseph Upton's Finding Aid reads, \"Arabic No. 42: [no neg]. Taq-i Bustan. Section of carpet in King's boat. Two squeezes, numbered 42/42a.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

