        "Local Numbers C-034 FSA A.6 06.C034",
        "Scope and Contents - Additional information from Joseph Upton's Finding Aid reads, \"Squeeze No. 34. ([neg.] 5061, right) Naqsh-i Rustam. L bab IIIa [Lines] 13-19.\"",
