    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement Papers squeezes are organized in sequential number following language scripts, which are housed in folders, and stored in metal flat files.",
        "Bibliography Herzfeld, Ernst: \"Bronzener 'Freibrief' eines Königs von Abdadana; Archäologische Mitteilungen aus Iran. Herausgegeben von Ernst Herzfeld. Band IX. Verlag von Dietrich Reimer, Berlin, 1938. Tafel I, bottom.\"",
        "General - Title is provided by Xavier Courouble, FSg Archives cataloger.",
        "Local Numbers C-59 FSA A.6 06.C059",
        "Scope and Contents - Additional information from Joseph Upton's Finding Aid reads, \"Squeeze No. 59. (no neg.) Bronze tablet. Front. AMI, vol.II, p.117 and vol.IX, p.159, p1.I, top.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Glass plates in Ernst Herzfeld Papers: [FSA A.6 04.GN.0303; FSA A.6 04.GN.0304; FSA A.6 04.GN.0305; FSA A.6 04.GN.0306; FSA A.6 04.GN.0307; FSA A.6 04.GN.0308; FSA A.6 04.GN.0388].",
        "Scope and Contents - Inventory of objects in Ernst Herzfeld Papers (N-91): [inventory number 2817].",
        "Scope and Contents - Sketchbook in Ernst Herzfeld Papers; SK-28, p.34 and 35." ;
